<title>SOUTH AFRICA: NEDCOR IN $6 MLN LOAN FOR PTA BANK. [CORRECTED 14:30 GMT]</title>
<headline>NEDCOR IN $6 MLN LOAN FOR PTA BANK. [CORRECTED 14:30 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nedcor Bank Ltd said on Wednesday it had signed a five-year $6 million (corrects figure from $6 billion, title and text) structured credit agreement with the Eastern and South African Trade and Development Bank, known as the PTA Bank.</p>
<p>The loan will enable South African company Meateng Africa (Pty) Ltd to fulfil a contract for the design, manufacure, installation and commissioning of an abattoir and meat processing plant in Omdurman, Sudan.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
